Added the control-panel API. `GET @identity-drivers` describes every registered driver and its config schema, which is what the Volto widget renders a form from; `@identity-providers` supports full CRUD plus a per-provider `test-connection` action that always checks live state rather than answering from the discovery cache. Everything needs `Manage portal`. Secrets stay write-only across the whole surface: what leaves is masked, and a round trip that PATCHes a masked config straight back leaves the stored secret alone. @ericof
